{"schemaVersion":{"minor":3,"patch":0,"major":0},"kind":"symbol","sections":[],"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"A drawing whose axes are eigenvectors of the Laplacian: x is the eigenvector of the second"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"smallest eigenvalue of L = D − A (the Fiedler vector of a connected graph) and y that of"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"the third, both of unit length, in "},{"code":"vertices","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" order."}],"metadata":{"extendedModule":"GraphProtocols","roleHeading":"Instance Method","fragments":[{"text":"func","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"spectralLayout","kind":"identifier"},{"text":"(","kind":"text"},{"text":"weight","kind":"externalParam"},{"text":": (","kind":"text"},{"text":"Self","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":".","kind":"text"},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:14GraphProtocols0A0P5EdgesQa","text":"Edges","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":".","kind":"text"},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:Sl5IndexQa","text":"Index","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":") -> ","kind":"text"},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:Sd","text":"Double","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":", ","kind":"text"},{"text":"maxIterations","kind":"externalParam"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:Si","text":"Int","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":"?) ","kind":"text"},{"text":"throws","kind":"keyword"},{"text":"(","kind":"text"},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:14GraphProtocols13NoConvergenceV","text":"NoConvergence","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":") -> ","kind":"text"},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:12GraphDrawing0B0V","text":"Drawing","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":"<","kind":"text"},{"text":"Self","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":".","kind":"text"},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:14GraphProtocols0A0P6VertexQa","text":"Vertex","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":">","kind":"text"}],"remoteSource":{"url":"https:\/\/github.com\/Tyler-Keith-Thompson\/Grafluent\/blob\/main\/Sources\/GraphDrawing\/SpectralLayout.swift#L30","fileName":"SpectralLayout.swift"},"modules":[{"relatedModules":["GraphProtocols"],"name":"GraphDrawing"}],"externalID":"s:14GraphProtocols0A0P0A7DrawingE14spectralLayout6weight13maxIterationsAD0C0Vy6VertexQzGSd5Edges_5IndexQZXE_SiSgtAA13NoConvergenceVYKF","symbolKind":"method","title":"spectralLayout(weight:maxIterations:)","role":"symbol"},"identifier":{"interfaceLanguage":"swift","url":"doc:\/\/GraphDrawing\/documentation\/GraphDrawing\/GraphProtocols\/Graph\/spectralLayout(weight:maxIterations:)"},"primaryContentSections":[{"declarations":[{"tokens":[{"text":"func","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"spectralLayout","kind":"identifier"},{"text":"(","kind":"text"},{"text":"weight","kind":"externalParam"},{"text":": (","kind":"text"},{"text":"Self","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":".","kind":"text"},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:14GraphProtocols0A0P5EdgesQa","text":"Edges","kind":"typeIdentifier","identifier":"doc:\/\/GraphProtocols\/documentation\/GraphProtocols\/Graph\/Edges-swift.associatedtype"},{"text":".","kind":"text"},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:Sl5IndexQa","text":"Index","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":") -> ","kind":"text"},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:Sd","text":"Double","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":" = { _ in 1 }, ","kind":"text"},{"text":"maxIterations","kind":"externalParam"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:Si","text":"Int","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":"? = nil) ","kind":"text"},{"text":"throws","kind":"keyword"},{"text":"(","kind":"text"},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:14GraphProtocols13NoConvergenceV","text":"NoConvergence","kind":"typeIdentifier","identifier":"doc:\/\/GraphProtocols\/documentation\/GraphProtocols\/NoConvergence"},{"text":") -> ","kind":"text"},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:12GraphDrawing0B0V","text":"Drawing","kind":"typeIdentifier","identifier":"doc:\/\/GraphDrawing\/documentation\/GraphDrawing\/Drawing"},{"text":"<","kind":"text"},{"text":"Self","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":".","kind":"text"},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:14GraphProtocols0A0P6VertexQa","text":"Vertex","kind":"typeIdentifier","identifier":"doc:\/\/GraphProtocols\/documentation\/GraphProtocols\/Graph\/Vertex"},{"text":">","kind":"text"}],"platforms":["Linux"],"languages":["swift"]}],"kind":"declarations"},{"content":[{"anchor":"discussion","type":"heading","text":"Discussion","level":2},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"A is the weighted adjacency matrix: parallel edges add their weights, self-loops are"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"ignored, and a weight of 0 is no edge. The eigenvalues are sorted ascending with their"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"multiplicity, so a graph with c components has c zero eigenvalues and its axes come from"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"eigenvectors of 0 when c > 1 (which ones is fixed by the solver, not specified). Each axis’s"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"sign makes its first entry, in "},{"code":"vertices","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" order, whose magnitude is at least 10⁻⁴ of its"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"largest positive. Two vertices have y = 0, and one vertex is at the origin. The drawing is"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"not rescaled ("},{"code":"rescaled(scale:center:)","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" maps it to a common frame). A directed graph is"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"drawn through "},{"code":"undirectedView","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":"."}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Dense: Householder tridiagonalization and the implicit QL iteration, O(n³) time and n²"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"code":"Double","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":"s, for graphs of up to a few thousand vertices."}]},{"type":"unorderedList","items":[{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Koren, “Drawing graphs by eigenvectors: theory and practice”, Computers & Mathematics with"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"Applications 49(11–12), 2005."}]}]}]},{"type":"aside","style":"note","content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"Every weight is finite and not negative; ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"maxIterations"},{"text":", when given, is at","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"least 1.","type":"text"}]}],"name":"Precondition"},{"type":"aside","style":"note","content":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":""},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"NoConvergence"},{"type":"text","text":" after "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"maxIterations"},{"type":"text","text":" QL iterations in all (30 n when nil), with"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"that count and the off-diagonal entry being reduced, relative to the largest entry of its"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"block. The iteration converges cubically, about two iterations per eigenvalue."}],"type":"paragraph"}],"name":"Throws"}],"kind":"content"}],"variants":[{"paths":["\/documentation\/graphdrawing\/graphprotocols\/graph\/spectrallayout(weight:maxiterations:)"],"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}]}],"hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/GraphDrawing\/documentation\/GraphDrawing","doc:\/\/GraphDrawing\/documentation\/GraphDrawing\/GraphProtocols","doc:\/\/GraphDrawing\/documentation\/GraphDrawing\/GraphProtocols\/Graph"]]},"references":{"doc://GraphProtocols/documentation/GraphProtocols/NoConvergence":{"title":"NoConvergence","type":"topic","navigatorTitle":[{"text":"NoConvergence","kind":"identifier"}],"fragments":[{"text":"struct","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"NoConvergence","kind":"identifier"}],"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"The error an iterative method throws when it uses up its iteration limit without meeting its"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"stopping rule."}],"kind":"sy